OL,3,GNEWSA'Gaming pays me double what I
OL,4,Aearned as a teacher'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn 2019, Jarvs Tasker was forced to
OL,7,Fgive up her teaching career due to
OL,8,Fchronic illness when she was just 28.
OL,10,FFast forward seven years, and she earns
OL,11,Fdouble her former annual salary,
OL,12,Frunning Jarvs Indie Insights, which
OL,13,Fprovides communication and marketing
OL,14,Fwithin the gaming industry.
OL,16,FShe visited the University of Suffolk's
OL,17,Fe-sport building in Ipswich to
OL,18,Fcelebrate independent game developers
OL,19,Fand studios on Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
