OL,3,GNEWSA'Gaming pays me double what I
OL,4,Aearned as a teacher'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I can comfortably say it probably
OL,7,Fwould have taken me about 20 years in
OL,8,Fteaching to earn what I make now," she
OL,9,Fsaid.
